WEBVTT
Kind: captions

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.240 position:63% line:0%
What happens to stainless&nbsp;
steel scissors in SCP-914?

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.860 position:63% line:0%
One pair of generic stainless steel scissors&nbsp;
was placed into the Clockworks on the setting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:13.240 position:63% line:0%
"Fine." The output produced was one pair&nbsp;
of visually unaltered scissors that cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.960 position:63% line:0%
cut solid matter. When the blades are&nbsp;
passed through a mass of liquid matter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.640 position:63% line:0%
the liquid separates into pieces that&nbsp;
cannot be put back together no matter what.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:26.680 position:63% line:0%
Further observation reveals that the separated&nbsp;
liquid behave similarly to oil and water when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:31.180 position:63% line:0%
introduced. The scissors returned to normal&nbsp;
after nine minutes and fourteen seconds.

